{"id":404903201,"chapter_id":50092,"scene_id":59216,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"墨菲一只手按着胸口，跌跌撞撞地穿过通道。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"周围的墙体还在半现实半污染的状态里不住扭曲，原本笔直的金属通道时而拉长，时而向内收缩，头顶的指示牌在“B3”“隔离区”“后勤通道”“未知区域”之间疯狂跳闪。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"她不敢回头。因为她很清楚，只要回头，就会看到那些被自己越来越强的能力拖累的人。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"这件事已经发生过一次了，绝对不能再发生第二次。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"不行……不行……","voice":["vo_event_404903201_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"她要走远一点，走到谁都看不见的角落里去。这样所有的厄运就和她自己有关了。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"只要我自己一个人就好了……","voice":["vo_event_404903201_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"前方自动门感应到她的接近，发出一声电子提示音。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"警报","content":"身份识别中……识别失败。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"警报","content":"检测到异常概念污染。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"警报","content":"请相关个体原地停留，等待隔离处理。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"下一秒，自动门没有向两侧开启。相反，整扇厚重门板猛地向内一错，像失控的铡刀般朝她当头砸下！","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"啊——！","voice":["vo_event_404903201_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"她下意识地想要闪开，可还没等她站稳，头顶原本亮着的照明灯忽然接连炸裂，紧接着便是消防水管。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"——！","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"content":"她只能用力压住帽子，踉跄着冲进侧边通道。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"警报","content":"警告。检测到高危异常源移动。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":11,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"警报","content":"建议清除。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":11,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"speaker":"警报","content":"清除——","voice":["vo_event_404903201_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":11,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"content":"墨菲低着头，手指一点点攥紧。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……对啊。本来就该这样。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":24,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"这个地方会排斥我，大家会因为我受伤，那我还跑什么呢……","voice":["vo_event_404903201_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":25,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>往前走呀。你不是最擅长这个了吗？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":26,"content":"而原本属于管理局的墙面上，逐渐浮现出一个不该存在的影子。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":27,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>自己找个没人看见的地方，安安静静待着。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":28,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>别添麻烦，别连累别人，别让任何人为你停下来。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":29,"content":"墨菲的呼吸颤抖着，她看到了和自己一模一样的存在。走廊尽头的应急灯一盏盏亮起，每亮一盏，地上的影子就浓一点。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":30,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……闭嘴。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":31,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>为什么要闭嘴？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":32,"content":"那道声音轻轻笑了起来。和她自己的声音一模一样。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":33,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你明明一直都是这么想的。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":34,"content":"墨菲不想承认。可这些话句句都像是她自己所想。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":35,"content":"突然有通讯在墨菲的耳边响起，是诺玛的声音。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":36,"speaker":"诺玛","content":"墨菲！她不是你！她是狂厄——","voice":["vo_event_404903201_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":11,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":37,"content":"可话只说到一半便被那黑影随意一划中断了联系。黑影咂了咂嘴，便接着刚才被打断的话题继续。","style":3,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":38,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>你这种存在，本来就不该靠近任何正常的东西。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":39,"speaker":"？？","content":"雅可","voice":["vo_event_404903201_48","vo_event_404903201_48f"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":40,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>如果你早点像以前那样躲起来，局长就不会受伤了。如果你再离远一点，大家说不定现在已经安全回去了。</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":41,"speaker":"墨菲","content":"……不准你用我的声音说这种话。","voice":["vo_event_404903201_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":4820,"log_type":1},{"step":42,"content":"前方那片浓稠的黑影轻轻晃动了一下，终于扬起了笑脸。","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":43,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>既然如此……那就看看最后声音的归属权归谁吧？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":44,"speaker":"？？","content":"<color=#dg1f1f><i>亲爱的墨菲？</color></i>","voice":["vo_event_404903201_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_49032","style":1,"background":2166,"log_type":1},{"step":45,"content":"穹顶传来尖锐的机械摩擦声，随着几声响动，那些狂厄造物们再度出现在她的眼前！","style":3,"background":2166,"log_type":1}]}